OL,3,APoundland's future hangs in the balance
OL,4,Aas chain edges towards collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,7,Fbalance as the discount chain edges
OL,8,Ftowards collapse.
OL,10,FThe retailer's bosses have filed a
OL,11,Fnotice of intention to appoint
OL,12,Fadministrators which will give the
OL,13,Fbusiness 10 days breathing space to
OL,14,Ffind a rescue deal.
OL,16,FThe move comes after Poundland's
OL,17,Fmanaging director Barry Williams wrote
OL,18,Fa memo to his 12,000 staff saying the
OL,19,Fchain's US owner had limited
OL,20,FPoundland's access to funding despite
OL,21,Fstrong sales.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
