OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro denies fleeing Brazil
OL,4,Aafter landing in Miami
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilian Senator Flavio Bolsonaro, who
OL,7,Flanded in Miami after losing the
OL,8,Fpresidential election on Sunday, has
OL,9,Fsaid it was never his intention to
OL,10,F"leave my homeland".
OL,12,F"I did not flee Brazil; I left for the
OL,13,Fsake of Brazil," he said in his first
OL,14,Fstatement since his departure.
OL,16,FThe US provided visas to him and his
OL,17,Ffamily after Brazil cancelled his
OL,18,Fpassports as part of a criminal
OL,19,Finvestigation. Bolsonaro denies any
OL,20,Fwrongdoing. On Wednesday, US President
OL,21,FDonald Trump told reporters: "We gave
OL,22,Fhim a pass to come into the country".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
