OL,3,ANetanyahu's bloc leading Israel
OL,4,Aelection but short of majority, partial
OL,5,Aresults show
OL,6,
OL,7,FPartial results from Israel's general
OL,8,Felection show veteran Prime Minister
OL,9,FBenjamin Netanyahu marginally ahead of
OL,10,Fhis rival, former military chief Gadi
OL,11,FEisenkot, but still short of a majority
OL,12,Fin parliament.
OL,14,FWith 97% of ballots counted,
OL,15,FNetanyahu's Likud party and its
OL,16,Ffar-right and ultra-Orthodox Jewish
OL,17,Fallies were on track to win 53 seats in
OL,18,Fthe 120-seat Knesset. Eisenkot's Yashar
OL,19,Fparty and three other Jewish opposition
OL,20,Fparties in his bloc were set for 48.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
