OL,3,ANetanyahu's bloc leading Israel
OL,4,Aelection but short of majority, partial
OL,5,Aresults show
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth leaders have said they will try to
OL,8,Fform a governing coalition.
OL,10,FArab-led parties, which are on course
OL,11,Fto win an unprecedented 19 seats, could
OL,12,Femerge as kingmakers. But all but one
OL,13,Fof the Jewish parties have pledged not
OL,14,Fto work with them.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
